  "title": "Ripley Main Street Receives $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant From The Hartford",
  "summary": "RIPLEY, Miss., July 28, 2026 Ripley Main Street has been awarded a $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant from The Hartford, in partnership with Main Street America. This grant will help develop Brown Covington, a new small business accelerator site that will support local artisans, emerging entrepreneurs and workforce development opportunities in downtown Ripley. Brown Covington will give artisans a place to create and sell products while receivi",
